OL,3,GNEWSATrump set to land in Dublin
OL,4,AAirport for two-day visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is set to
OL,7,Farrive in Dublin on Saturday morning
OL,8,Ffor a two-day visit to the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FHe is due to meet Irish President
OL,12,FCatherine Connolly and hold a bilateral
OL,13,Fmeeting with Taoiseach (Irish prime
OL,14,Fminister) Micheal Martin
OL,16,FTrump will then travel to his golf
OL,17,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare
OL,19,FThe course is hosting the Irish Open,
OL,20,Fwhere Rory McIlroy will defend the
OL,21,Ftitle he won in 2025
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
